silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#mittensgovernedindividual a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.04_colimit_above_granite.concrete_anchor#mittensgovernedindividual" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#mittensgovernedindividual silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedIndividual is the governed Mittens individual — the colimit assembled from all typed legs: type (Cat), domestic-cat refinement, taxonomy (Felis catus/TSN 183798), evidence (vet record), quality (4.3 kg), process (annual exam), role (clinic patient), storage (Icechunk chunk)." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#granitestoragemanifestsubcategory a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.04_colimit_above_granite.concrete_anchor#granitestoragemanifestsubcategory" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#granitestoragemanifestsubcategory silm:hasLongDescription "The GraniteStorageManifestSubcategory is the manifest/storage subcategory: chunk manifests (c-0x7f4a, c-0x3b1c, c-0x8e2d), versioned snapshots, content-addressed records — all storage-layer Icechunk artifacts. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'M_Granite', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#nonstorageologobjects a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.04_colimit_above_granite.concrete_anchor#nonstorageologobjects" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#nonstorageologobjects silm:hasLongDescription "The NonStorageOlogObjects is nodes in the full Granite olog that are not storage nodes: Mittens (apex), Cat, DomesticCat, VetCarePlan_77, taxonomy nodes, evidence nodes, quality/measurement nodes. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'G_Granite setminus M_Granite', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#coconelegstomittensapex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.04_colimit_above_granite.concrete_anchor#coconelegstomittensapex" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#coconelegstomittensapex silm:hasLongDescription "The CoconeLegsToMittensApex is the cocone legs from each source-diagram object to the Mittens apex: type leg from Cat node, taxonomy leg from Felis catus/TSN 183798 node, evidence leg from vet-record node, quality leg from body-mass node, storage leg from ChunkManifest node." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#universalmediatortovetcareplan77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.04_colimit_above_granite.concrete_anchor#universalmediatortovetcareplan77" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#universalmediatortovetcareplan77 silm:hasLongDescription "The UniversalMediatorToVetCarePlan77 is the universal-mediator arrow from VetCarePlan_77 (clinical care plan record 77 at Tartu clinic) to the colimit apex — the competing cocone that proves the apex cannot be a storage node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'u', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#materializationfunctorgtom a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.01_storage_as_leg.sections.04_colimit_above_granite.concrete_anchor#materializationfunctorgtom" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_04_colimit_above_granite_concrete_anchor#materializationfunctorgtom silm:hasLongDescription "The MaterializationFunctorGToM is the materialization functor F: G_Granite -> M_Granite that maps governed objects to their Icechunk chunk manifests and governed arrows to manifest-level arrows. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'F', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
